{"jsonapi":{"version":"1.0","meta":{"links":{"self":{"href":"http:\/\/jsonapi.org\/format\/1.0\/"}}},"parsed":true},"data":{"type":"information","id":"d23361a9-7ab4-440a-b261-42e9cf8c3bf1","links":{"self":{"href":"http:\/\/www.comune.padova.it\/api\/informations\/d23361a9-7ab4-440a-b261-42e9cf8c3bf1?resourceVersion=id%3A212389"}},"title":"Elenco zone a traffico limitato notturno","moderation_state":"published","path":{"alias":"\/elenco-zone-traffico-limitato-notturno","pid":30888,"langcode":"it"},"information_desc":"In\u00a0via Mortise, via del Pescarotto, via Anelli e in zona Arcella","drupal_internal__nid":29628,"status":true,"created":"2010-10-28T06:56:08+00:00","changed":"2024-12-10T14:44:17+00:00","publish_on":null,"unpublish_on":null,"publish_state":null,"unpublish_state":null,"field_hide_sidebar":false,"field_legacy_nid":"8071","information_body":null,"field_tags":[{"type":"tag","id":"04779683-6c12-4d49-b66e-b3776ae8f73a","meta":{"drupal_internal__target_id":93865}}],"node_type":{"type":"node_type--node_type","id":"9edfa1a4-9ea6-49b1-9fbd-1d06f97ec9d5","meta":{"drupal_internal__target_id":"information"}},"field_image":{"data":null,"links":{"related":{"href":"http:\/\/www.comune.padova.it\/api\/informations\/d23361a9-7ab4-440a-b261-42e9cf8c3bf1\/field_image?resourceVersion=id%3A212389"},"self":{"href":"http:\/\/www.comune.padova.it\/api\/informations\/d23361a9-7ab4-440a-b261-42e9cf8c3bf1\/relationships\/field_image?resourceVersion=id%3A212389"}}},"field_internal_image":{"data":null,"links":{"related":{"href":"http:\/\/www.comune.padova.it\/api\/informations\/d23361a9-7ab4-440a-b261-42e9cf8c3bf1\/field_internal_image?resourceVersion=id%3A212389"},"self":{"href":"http:\/\/www.comune.padova.it\/api\/informations\/d23361a9-7ab4-440a-b261-42e9cf8c3bf1\/relationships\/field_internal_image?resourceVersion=id%3A212389"}}},"field_objectives":{"data":[],"links":{"related":{"href":"http:\/\/www.comune.padova.it\/api\/informations\/d23361a9-7ab4-440a-b261-42e9cf8c3bf1\/field_objectives?resourceVersion=id%3A212389"},"self":{"href":"http:\/\/www.comune.padova.it\/api\/informations\/d23361a9-7ab4-440a-b261-42e9cf8c3bf1\/relationships\/field_objectives?resourceVersion=id%3A212389"}}},"information_partials":[{"type":"text","id":"dea5f340-3440-455c-bea7-76b3a69ee326","links":{"self":{"href":"http:\/\/www.comune.padova.it\/api\/partials\/text\/dea5f340-3440-455c-bea7-76b3a69ee326?resourceVersion=id%3A192286"}},"drupal_internal__id":56136,"status":true,"created":"2024-11-28T20:02:09+00:00","text_body":{"value":"\u003C?xml encoding=\u0022utf-8\u0022 ?\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAlcune zone della citt\u0026agrave; vivono, nelle ore notturne, situazioni di circolazione e traffico stradale improprie provocate da attivit\u0026agrave; quali la prostituzione o lo spaccio di stupefacenti.\u003Cbr\u003E\r\nQueste situazioni causano problemi di ordine pubblico, di salute e di igiene pubblica, oltre a generare un forte disagio per i residenti della zona.\u003Cbr\u003E\r\n\u003Cbr\u003E\r\nL\u0027Amministrazione ha istituito una zona a traffico limitato notturno\u0026nbsp;nelle aree interessate, in modo tale da ridurre\u0026nbsp;l\u0027ingresso dei veicoli non autorizzati e facilitare la circolazione.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\r\n\u003Cbr\u003E\r\n\u003Cstrong\u003EDOVE E\u0027 IN VIGORE LA ZTL NOTTURNA\u003C\/strong\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Cbr\u003E\r\n\u0026gt;\u0026nbsp;\u003Ca href=\u0022http:\/\/www.padovanet.it\/dettaglio.jsp?tasstipo=C\u0026amp;tassidpadre=211\u0026amp;tassid=1619\u0026amp;id=7427\u0022\u003Evia\u0026nbsp;del Pescarotto e via Mortise\u003C\/a\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Cbr\u003E\r\n\u0026gt;\u0026nbsp;\u003Ca href=\u0022http:\/\/www.padovanet.it\/dettaglio.jsp?tasstipo=C\u0026amp;tassidpadre=211\u0026amp;tassid=1619\u0026amp;id=8665\u0022\u003Evia Anelli e vie limitrofe\u003C\/a\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Cbr\u003E\r\n\u0026gt;\u0026nbsp;\u003Ca href=\u0022http:\/\/www.padovanet.it\/dettaglio.jsp?tasstipo=C\u0026amp;tassidpadre=211\u0026amp;tassid=1619\u0026amp;id=14706\u0022\u003Etra le vie Jacopo d\u0027Avanzo e Giusto de\u0027 Menabuoi\u003C\/a\u003E\u0026nbsp;(Arcella)\u003Cbr\u003E\r\n\u003Cbr\u003E\r\n\u003Cbr\u003E\r\n\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003C\/p\u003E\n","format":null,"processed":"\u003Cp\u003E\u0026lt;?xml encoding=\u0026quot;utf-8\u0026quot; ?\u0026gt;\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;Alcune zone della citt\u0026amp;agrave; vivono, nelle ore notturne, situazioni di circolazione e traffico stradale improprie provocate da attivit\u0026amp;agrave; quali la prostituzione o lo spaccio di stupefacenti.\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;\u003Cbr \/\u003E\nQueste situazioni causano problemi di ordine pubblico, di salute e di igiene pubblica, oltre a generare un forte disagio per i residenti della zona.\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;\u003Cbr \/\u003E\nL\u0026#039;Amministrazione ha istituito una zona a traffico limitato notturno\u0026amp;nbsp;nelle aree interessate, in modo tale da ridurre\u0026amp;nbsp;l\u0026#039;ingresso dei veicoli non autorizzati e facilitare la circolazione.\u0026lt;\/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;DOVE E\u0026#039; IN VIGORE LA ZTL NOTTURNA\u0026lt;\/strong\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u0026amp;gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;a href=\u0026quot;\u003Ca href=\u0022http:\/\/www.padovanet.it\/dettaglio.jsp?tasstipo=C\u0026amp;amp;tassidpadre=211\u0026amp;amp;tassid=1619\u0026amp;amp;id=7427\u0026quot;\u0026gt;via\u0026amp;nbsp;del\u0022\u003Ehttp:\/\/www.padovanet.it\/dettaglio.jsp?tasstipo=C\u0026amp;amp;tassidpadre=211\u0026amp;am\u2026\u003C\/a\u003E Pescarotto e via Mortise\u0026lt;\/a\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u0026amp;gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;a href=\u0026quot;\u003Ca href=\u0022http:\/\/www.padovanet.it\/dettaglio.jsp?tasstipo=C\u0026amp;amp;tassidpadre=211\u0026amp;amp;tassid=1619\u0026amp;amp;id=8665\u0026quot;\u0026gt;via\u0022\u003Ehttp:\/\/www.padovanet.it\/dettaglio.jsp?tasstipo=C\u0026amp;amp;tassidpadre=211\u0026amp;am\u2026\u003C\/a\u003E Anelli e vie limitrofe\u0026lt;\/a\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u0026amp;gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;a href=\u0026quot;\u003Ca href=\u0022http:\/\/www.padovanet.it\/dettaglio.jsp?tasstipo=C\u0026amp;amp;tassidpadre=211\u0026amp;amp;tassid=1619\u0026amp;amp;id=14706\u0026quot;\u0026gt;tra\u0022\u003Ehttp:\/\/www.padovanet.it\/dettaglio.jsp?tasstipo=C\u0026amp;amp;tassidpadre=211\u0026amp;am\u2026\u003C\/a\u003E le vie Jacopo d\u0026#039;Avanzo e Giusto de\u0026#039; Menabuoi\u0026lt;\/a\u0026gt;\u0026amp;nbsp;(Arcella)\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;\/p\u0026gt;\u003C\/p\u003E\n"},"text_title":null,"meta":{"target_revision_id":192286,"drupal_internal__target_id":56136},"paragraph_type":{"type":"paragraphs_type--paragraphs_type","id":"ccf84c64-f997-47ef-a79e-ed7e27dac27f","meta":{"drupal_internal__target_id":"text"}}}]},"links":{"self":{"href":"http:\/\/www.comune.padova.it\/api\/informations\/d23361a9-7ab4-440a-b261-42e9cf8c3bf1?include=information_partials\u0026jsonapi_include=1"}}}